∇Z←dm∆MultivariatePolynomial∆new B;⍙M;⍙E
⍝ Sparse multivariate polynomial over the reals in a fixed number of variables (x0, x1, ...), stored internally as a map from exponent vector to coefficient. Exposed to bindings via parallel arrays (exponents()/coefficients()) rather than the internal map, matching this module's std::map-avoidance convention for SWIG-facing types.
