∇Z←dm∆Point2D∆new B;⍙M;⍙E
⍝ A copied point or free vector with ordinary double coordinates. Construction does not validate finiteness; checked algorithms document their own input contracts. Default coordinates are zero. Equality is numeric, so signed zeros compare equal and NaN coordinates do not compare equal.
