∇Z←dm∆Triangle∆new B;⍙M;⍙E
⍝ Three original point indices in counterclockwise order for finite mesh faces. Original field layout/defaults are retained. A trace ghost uses c=points.size() as a symbolic infinity marker, with a,b the reversed finite hull edge; it is never returned by delaunay_triangulation(). No coordinate is constructed for it.
⍝
⍝ **Example**
⍝ ```
⍝ const dm::geometry::Triangle t{0,1,2};std::print("{} {} {}\n",t.a,t.b,t.c); // 0 1 2
⍝ ```
