⍝ A vector-valued function R^n -> R^m: the state-transition or observation model supplied to this module's nonlinear filters (ExtendedKalmanFilter, UnscentedKalmanFilter, EnsembleKalmanFilter, ParticleFilter). Director-enabled (subclass directly in C++, or via SWIG directors in any bound language) so this module never needs to know the concrete form of the caller's dynamics.
