∇Z←dm∆ClosestPairResult∆new B;⍙M;⍙E
⍝ Owned closest-point coordinate copies and legacy finite-double distance. Original field order/types are retained. Equal measured distances keep the earliest original index pair in the scan. Default storage alone is not a valid search result. No input references or global mutable state are retained.
