∇Z←dm∆ConvexHullOptions∆new B;⍙M;⍙E
⍝ Limits for complete input storage and actual optional hull trace events. Full finite validation precedes max_points preflight; max_events is an online count of actual test/pop/push records, ignored by untraced calls. Zero disables either cap. No partial result escapes a failed cap.
⍝
⍝ **Example**
⍝ ```
⍝ dm::geometry::ConvexHullOptions o;
⍝ std::cout << o.max_points << ' ' << o.max_events; // 1000000 1000000
⍝ ```
