∇Z←dm∆HullIndexedPoint∆new B;⍙M;⍙E
⍝ Owned distinct coordinate with the earliest matching input identity. Exact equality coalesces duplicates and signed zeros; sorting ties by original index retains the earliest coordinate representation. Output owns the point.
⍝
⍝ **Example**
⍝ ```
⍝ const auto t=dm::geometry::convex_hull_trace({{1,0},{0,0},{1,0}});
⍝ std::cout << t.sorted[1].input_index; // 0
⍝ ```
⍝
⍝ **Members:** `dm∆HullIndexedPoint∆point` (field), `dm∆HullIndexedPoint∆input_index` (field).
⍝
