∇H dm∆Plot∆view B;⍙M;⍙E;⍙Z
⍝ Same as show(); kept as an alias for older code.
⍝
⍝ **Usage:**
⍝ ```apl
⍝ obj dm∆Plot∆view ⍬
⍝ obj dm∆Plot∆view title_hint
⍝ ```
⍝ The right argument is the vector of arguments (one argument may be given alone; ⍬ for none).
⍝
⍝ **Arguments:**
⍝ - `title_hint` character vector, default '': Window title; empty uses the plot's title.
⍝
⍝ **Errors:**
⍝ - DOMAIN ERROR `dm: native: …`: As for show(). (C++ `std::runtime_error`)
⍝
⍝ - C++: `void datamunge::graphics::Plot::view(const std::string & title_hint = "") const`
⍝
⍝ **See also:** `dm∆show()`
