⍝ **Usage:**
⍝ ```apl
⍝ Z←obj dm∆RPlot∆set_title value
⍝ ```
⍝
⍝ **Arguments:**
⍝ - `value` character vector: Heading text.
⍝
⍝ **Result:** RPlot handle: This plot, for chaining.
⍝
