∇Z←H dm∆RPlot∆axis_color B;⍙M;⍙E
⍝ Sets the color of the axis lines and of all plot-level text: tick labels, axis labels, title, and subtitle (R's `col.axis`, `col.lab`, and `col.main` in one).
⍝
⍝ The default is slate gray `{55, 65, 81}`. Legend text follows it too; text() labels and
⍝ data layers keep their own colors.
