⍝
⍝ **Arguments:**
⍝ - `min_x` number: Left edge in data units.
⍝ - `max_x` number: Right edge; must be greater than min_x.
⍝
⍝ **Result:** RPlot handle: This plot, for chaining.
⍝
⍝ **Errors:**
⍝ - DOMAIN ERROR `dm: invalid_argument: …`: Unless max_x > min_x (NaN fails); the plot is unchanged. (C++ `std::invalid_argument`)
