⍝ ```apl
⍝ Z←obj dm∆RPlot∆hide_axes ⍬
⍝ Z←obj dm∆RPlot∆hide_axes enabled
⍝ ```
⍝ The right argument is the vector of arguments (one argument may be given alone; ⍬ for none).
⍝
⍝ **Arguments:**
⍝ - `enabled` boolean (0 or 1), default 1: True (the default) hides them; false shows them again.
⍝
⍝ **Result:** RPlot handle: This plot, for chaining.
⍝
⍝ - C++: `RPlot & datamunge::graphics::RPlot::hide_axes(bool enabled = true)`
⍝
⍝ **See also:** `dm∆show_grid()`, `dm∆margins()`
