∇H dm∆RLayout∆save B;⍙M;⍙E;⍙Z
⍝ Saves the figure, choosing the format from the extension: `.svg` (or none) writes SVG, `.png` / `.pdf` write the same tiled raster the X11 viewer shows.
⍝
⍝ The extension is case-sensitive and an existing file is overwritten. Raster panels are
⍝ re-rendered from the stored copies and scaled into their cells.
⍝
⍝ **Example**
⍝ See RLayout.
⍝
⍝ **Usage:**
⍝ ```apl
⍝ obj dm∆RLayout∆save path
⍝ ```
⍝
⍝ **Arguments:**
⍝ - `path` character vector: Destination file.
⍝
⍝ **Errors:**
⍝ - DOMAIN ERROR `dm: invalid_argument: …`: For any other extension. (C++ `std::invalid_argument`)
⍝ - DOMAIN ERROR `dm: native: …`: If the file cannot be written. (C++ `std::runtime_error`)
⍝
⍝ - C++: `void datamunge::graphics::RLayout::save(const std::string & path) const`
⍝
⍝ **See also:** `dm∆save_svg()`, `dm∆to_svg()`, `dm∆show()`
