⍝ - `path` character vector: Destination file; an existing file is overwritten.
⍝
⍝ **Errors:**
⍝ - DOMAIN ERROR `dm: native: …`: If the file cannot be written or a panel cannot be rendered. (C++ `std::runtime_error`)
⍝
⍝ - C++: `void datamunge::graphics::RLayout::save_pdf(const std::string & path) const`
