⍝ obj←dm∆RHS∆new
⍝ ```
⍝
⍝ **Result:** RHS handle
⍝
⍝ - C++: `datamunge::ode::RHS::RHS()`
 (⍙M ⍙E Z)←(¯2 2 1173) dm⍙native ⍬
 ⍙M ⎕ES ⍙E
∇

