∇Z←dm∆CrossEntropyMethodOptions∆smoothing H;⍙M;⍙E
⍝ Exponential smoothing factor in (0, 1] blending the new elite statistics with the previous generation's: new = smoothing * elite_stat + (1 - smoothing) * old. smoothing == 1 means full replacement each iteration (no smoothing at all).
