∇Z←dm∆NesterovAcceleratedGradientOptions∆new B;⍙M;⍙E
⍝ Configuration for NesterovAcceleratedGradient; fields retain their documented native defaults. Supply finite values in the supported ranges. Controls are copied at construction; validation, stopping and loss scaling belong to optimize().
⍝
⍝ **Example**
⍝ ```
⍝ dm::optim::NesterovAcceleratedGradientOptions o;
⍝ std::print("{}\n",o.max_iterations); // 10000
⍝ ```
