⍝
⍝ - C++: `const SGDOptions & datamunge::optim::SGD::options() const`
 (⍙M ⍙E Z)←(1809 2 H) dm⍙native ⍬
 ⍙M ⎕ES ⍙E
∇

∇Z←dm∆SimulatedAnnealingOptions∆new B;⍙M;⍙E
⍝ Configuration for SimulatedAnnealing; fields retain their documented native defaults. Supply finite values in the supported ranges. Controls are copied at construction; validation, stopping and loss scaling belong to optimize().
⍝
⍝ **Example**
⍝ ```
⍝ dm::optim::SimulatedAnnealingOptions o;
⍝ std::print("{}\n",o.max_iterations); // 10000
