∇Z←dm∆WhaleOptimization∆new B;⍙M;⍙E
⍝ Whale Optimization Algorithm (Mirjalili & Lewis, 2016): a population of whales alternates between encircling prey, random search, and a logarithmic bubble-net spiral to home in on the best point found so far. Derivative-free, box-constrained.
⍝
⍝ **Members:** `dm∆WhaleOptimization∆optimize`, `dm∆WhaleOptimization∆options`.
⍝
