⍝ - `options` WhaleOptimizationOptions handle, default the C++ default
⍝
⍝ **Result:** WhaleOptimization handle
⍝
⍝ - C++: `datamunge::optim::WhaleOptimization::WhaleOptimization(WhaleOptimizationOptions options = {})`
 (⍙M ⍙E Z)←(¯2 1 1888) dm⍙native B
 ⍙M ⎕ES ⍙E
