⍝ SWIG-friendly facade for datamunge::stats::RandomForestClassifier — a bagged ensemble of CART trees, each fit on a bootstrap sample with a random subset of predictors considered at every split.
⍝
⍝ **Members:** `dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆classes`, `dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆predictor_names`, `dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆observations`, `dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆n_trees`, `dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆max_features_used`, `dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆feature_importance`, `dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆training_accuracy`, `dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆oob_accuracy`, `dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆confusion_matrix`, `dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆summary`, `dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆print_summary`, `dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆predict`, `dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆predict_frame`, `dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆plot_classification`, `dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆plot_decision_regions`.
⍝
