⍝ ```apl
⍝ obj←dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆new data formula
⍝ obj←dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆new data formula n_trees
⍝ obj←dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆new data formula n_trees max_depth
⍝ obj←dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆new data formula n_trees max_depth min_samples_split
⍝ obj←dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆new data formula n_trees max_depth min_samples_split min_samples_leaf
⍝ obj←dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆new data formula n_trees max_depth min_samples_split min_samples_leaf max_features
⍝ obj←dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆new data formula n_trees max_depth min_samples_split min_samples_leaf max_features criterion
⍝ obj←dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆new data formula n_trees max_depth min_samples_split min_samples_leaf max_features criterion bootstrap
⍝ obj←dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆new data formula n_trees max_depth min_samples_split min_samples_leaf max_features criterion bootstrap sample_fraction
⍝ obj←dm∆RandomForestClassifier∆new data formula n_trees max_depth min_samples_split min_samples_leaf max_features criterion bootstrap sample_fraction seed
⍝ ```
⍝ The right argument is the vector of arguments (one argument may be given alone; ⍬ for none).
⍝
⍝ **Arguments:**
⍝ - `data` DataFrame handle
⍝ - `formula` character vector
⍝ - `n_trees` integer, default 100
⍝ - `max_depth` integer, default 10
⍝ - `min_samples_split` integer, default 2
⍝ - `min_samples_leaf` integer, default 1
⍝ - `max_features` integer, default 0: 0 = auto (floor(sqrt(number of predictors))).
⍝ - `criterion` character vector, default 'gini': "gini" (default) or "entropy".
⍝ - `bootstrap` boolean (0 or 1), default 1
⍝ - `sample_fraction` number, default 1.0
⍝ - `seed` integer, default 42
⍝
⍝ **Result:** RandomForestClassifier handle
⍝
