⍝ ```apl
⍝ obj←dm∆MDS∆new data feature_columns
⍝ obj←dm∆MDS∆new data feature_columns n_components
⍝ obj←dm∆MDS∆new data feature_columns n_components metric
⍝ obj←dm∆MDS∆new data encoded_feature_columns
⍝ obj←dm∆MDS∆new data encoded_feature_columns n_components
