⍝ SWIG-friendly facade for datamunge::stats::DiffusionMaps — embeds points via the leading eigenvectors of a dense, alpha-normalized heat-kernel Markov transition matrix, scaled by eigenvalue^diffusion_time. Distinct from LaplacianEigenmaps (sparse k-NN graph Laplacian, no density normalization).
