⍝
⍝ **Usage:**
⍝ ```apl
⍝ obj←dm∆KernelRegression∆new data formula
⍝ obj←dm∆KernelRegression∆new data formula kernel
⍝ obj←dm∆KernelRegression∆new data formula kernel bandwidth
⍝ obj←dm∆KernelRegression∆new data formula kernel bandwidth n_bandwidth
