⍝ obj←dm∆GLM∆new data formula
⍝ obj←dm∆GLM∆new data formula family
⍝ obj←dm∆GLM∆new data formula family weights_column
⍝ obj←dm∆GLM∆new data formula family weights_column max_iter
⍝ obj←dm∆GLM∆new data formula family weights_column max_iter tol
⍝ ```
⍝ The right argument is the vector of arguments (one argument may be given alone; ⍬ for none).
⍝
⍝ **Arguments:**
⍝ - `data` DataFrame handle
⍝ - `formula` character vector
⍝ - `family` character vector, default 'gaussian': One of "gaussian" (identity link), "binomial" (logit link), "poisson" (log link), or "Gamma" (inverse link).
⍝ - `weights_column` character vector, default '': Optional column name enabling prior weights; pass "" (the default) for none.
⍝ - `max_iter` integer, default 25
⍝ - `tol` number, default 1.0E¯8
⍝
⍝ **Result:** GLM handle
