⍝ **Errors:**
⍝ - INDEX ERROR `dm: out_of_range: …`: For invalid levels/indices. (C++ `std::out_of_range`)
⍝ - DOMAIN ERROR `dm: invalid_argument: …`: On a dimension mismatch. (C++ `std::invalid_argument`)
