∇Z←dm∆TaskOutput∆new B;⍙M;⍙E
⍝ Preallocated observations, rewards and independent episode-end flags. Observations are row-major [environments,observation_size]. Terminal observations stay in final_observations until the next terminal transition for that index. No auto-reset occurs. Masked-out rows keep all previous values.
⍝
⍝ **Example**
⍝ ```
⍝ dm::sim::TaskBatch task(dm::sim::Task::InvertedPendulum,2);
⍝ const auto& result=task.output();
⍝ ```
⍝
⍝ **Members:** `dm∆TaskOutput∆observations` (field), `dm∆TaskOutput∆rewards` (field), `dm∆TaskOutput∆terminated` (field), `dm∆TaskOutput∆truncated` (field), `dm∆TaskOutput∆final_observations` (field), `dm∆TaskOutput∆final_valid` (field).
⍝
⍝ Handles are `('TaskOutput' id)`; release them with `dm∆Delete obj`.
⍝
⍝ **Usage:**
⍝ ```apl
⍝ obj←dm∆TaskOutput∆new
⍝ ```
⍝
⍝ **Result:** TaskOutput handle
⍝
⍝ - C++: `datamunge::sim::TaskOutput::TaskOutput()`
