∇Z←H dm∆TaskBatch∆step B;⍙M;⍙E
⍝ Advance selected task rows and retain final observations on episode end. Selected completed rows must be reset first. An unselected row remains unchanged.
⍝
⍝ **Example**
⍝ ```
⍝ dm::sim::TaskBatch task(dm::sim::Task::Hopper,1);
⍝ const auto& result=task.step({0,0,0});
⍝ ```
⍝
⍝ **Usage:**
⍝ ```apl
⍝ Z←obj dm∆TaskBatch∆step actions
⍝ Z←obj dm∆TaskBatch∆step actions mask
⍝ ```
⍝ The right argument is the vector of arguments (one argument may be given alone; ⍬ for none).
⍝
⍝ **Arguments:**
⍝ - `actions` numeric vector: Row-major [size(),action_size()] values in the documented action box.
⍝ - `mask` integer vector, default the C++ default: Empty selects all; otherwise size() binary bytes.
⍝
⍝ **Result:** TaskOutput handle: Borrowed reusable rollout output; no automatic reset.
⍝
⍝ **Errors:**
⍝ - DOMAIN ERROR `dm: invalid_argument: …`: Invalid action shape/value or mask, before mutation. (C++ `std::invalid_argument`)
⍝ - DOMAIN ERROR `dm: native: …`: A selected row already finished. (C++ `std::logic_error`)
⍝ - DOMAIN ERROR `dm: native: …`: Physics failure; explicit reset is required before retrying. (C++ `std::exception`)
⍝
⍝ - C++: `const TaskOutput & datamunge::sim::TaskBatch::step(const std::vector<double> & actions, const std::vector<std::uint8_t> & mask = {})`
 (⍙M ⍙E Z)←(3168 1 H) dm⍙native B
 ⍙M ⎕ES ⍙E
∇

∇Z←H dm∆TaskBatch∆reset B;⍙M;⍙E
⍝ Restore and perturb selected rows; retain final observations for rollout collectors. Clears rewards/end flags for selected rows. Random streams continue between episodes.
⍝
⍝ **Example**
⍝ ```
⍝ dm::sim::TaskBatch task(dm::sim::Task::InvertedPendulum,2);task.reset({0,1});
⍝ ```
⍝
⍝ **Usage:**
⍝ ```apl
⍝ Z←obj dm∆TaskBatch∆reset ⍬
⍝ Z←obj dm∆TaskBatch∆reset mask
⍝ ```
⍝ The right argument is the vector of arguments (one argument may be given alone; ⍬ for none).
⍝
⍝ **Arguments:**
⍝ - `mask` integer vector, default the C++ default: Empty selects all; otherwise size() binary bytes.
⍝
⍝ **Result:** TaskOutput handle: Borrowed reset observations and current unselected rows.
⍝
⍝ **Errors:**
⍝ - DOMAIN ERROR `dm: invalid_argument: …`: Invalid mask. (C++ `std::invalid_argument`)
⍝
⍝ - C++: `const TaskOutput & datamunge::sim::TaskBatch::reset(const std::vector<std::uint8_t> & mask = {})`
 (⍙M ⍙E Z)←(3169 1 H) dm⍙native B
 ⍙M ⎕ES ⍙E
∇

