⍝ - `se` integer (dm∆StructuringElement∆…, or the enumerator's name), default dm∆StructuringElement∆Square
⍝ - `radius` integer, default 1
⍝
⍝ **Result:** Image handle
⍝
⍝ - C++: `image::Image datamunge::cv::dilate(const image::Image & img, StructuringElement se = Square, int radius = 1)`
 (⍙M ⍙E Z)←(80 1) dm⍙native B
 ⍙M ⎕ES ⍙E
