⍝ **Usage:**
⍝ ```apl
⍝ Z←dm∆data_home
⍝ ```
⍝
⍝ **Result:** character vector: The directory path (it may not exist yet).
⍝
⍝ - C++: `std::string datamunge::datasets::data_home()`
⍝
⍝ **See also:** `dm∆fetch()`
