∇Z←dm∆downloadable;⍙M;⍙E
⍝ The names fetch() accepts, sorted: "california_housing", "cifar10", "cifar100", "diamonds", "fashion_mnist", "karate_club", "mnist", "rebot_devarm", "sudoku".
⍝
⍝ **Example**
