⍝ **Errors:**
⍝ - DOMAIN ERROR `dm: invalid_argument: …`: Nonpositive or nonfinite extent. (C++ `std::invalid_argument`)
⍝ - LENGTH ERROR `dm: length_error: …`: Optional count cap or container capacity exceeded before allocation. (C++ `std::length_error`)
⍝ - WS FULL `dm: allocation: …`: Allocation fails. (C++ `std::bad_alloc`)
⍝
⍝ - C++: `std::vector<Point2D> datamunge::geometry::delaunay_uniform_cloud(std::size_t count, std::uint32_t seed = 20250728, double extent = 10.0, std::size_t max_points = 1000000)`
