⍝
⍝ **Arguments:**
⍝ - `x0` number
⍝ - `y0` number
⍝ - `x1` number
⍝ - `y1` number
⍝ - `nx` integer
⍝ - `ny` integer
⍝
⍝ **Result:** Mesh2D handle
⍝
⍝ - C++: `Mesh2D datamunge::fem::make_rectangular_mesh2d(double x0, double y0, double x1, double y1, std::size_t nx, std::size_t ny)`
